  "body": "I wanted to refactor `getSVGDocument()` to use the content document concept, but the former uses the origin of the container's node document and the latter uses the current settings object's origin.\r\n\r\nI suspect that implementations are better than this and have only one security check, but this needs to be tested. I think the difference can be tested by grabbing a reference and then changing the origin of the \"current script\" while not changing the origin of the container's node document or its nested browsing context.",
